# Third-party notices

RADIAL is built on the open-source components listed below. This file is generated by
`node scripts/generate-notices.mjs` (cargo-about) and covers every Rust crate
compiled into the application.

Also shipped with the app, with their own licence files:

- **PDFium** (`pdfium/pdfium.dll`) — BSD-3-Clause; see `pdfium/LICENSE` and `pdfium/licenses/`.
- **DejaVu Sans** font (compiled in) — see `notices/DejaVu-LICENSE.txt`.
- **Inter** font (interface) — SIL Open Font License 1.1; see `notices/Inter-LICENSE.txt`.
- Interface JavaScript packages (React, Tauri API) — MIT; see `package.json`.

